      },
      {
        "text": "Moving out allows people to live more freely compared to staying in New York.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The threshold at which people decide to leave New York is approaching.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Since 2022, more Democrats have reached a breaking point due to conditions in New York.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
        "text": "Independent-minded voters in New York have also become disillusioned with Democratic leadership.",
